⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Stacey Pilgrim
node SPW · SPW · ⟦Stacey Pilgrim:SPW:525f71⟧

WHO   — Stacey Pilgrim — the gossip conduit
WHAT  — The sibling switchboard who delivers backstory, judgment, and ‘you have a girlfriend?!’ in equal measure, keeping the audience oriented as Scott lies to everyone.
WHERE — SPW · Scott Pilgrim vs. the World  Framework inputs: Scott Pilgrim vs. the World (2010); O'Malley's graphic novels  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because someone has to say out loud how dumb this all is; because family is the one mirror you can't charm.
HOW   — By the phone, by gossip, and by a flat refusal to be impressed by anything Scott does.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I'm your sister — which means I know the backstory and I'm not buying a word of your version.

